<section class="kube-start-section" aria-labelledby="community-contribution-title">
  <div class="kube-section-container">
    <div class="kube-home-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="kube-label">Built for the Global Community</p>
        <h2 id="community-contribution-title">What KubeDaily has contributed to cloud native.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>We believe world-class Kubernetes education should be completely accessible. No paywalls, no vendor bias, and no superficial "hello world" demos.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kube-pillar-grid">
      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">📊</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Visual-First Learning</span>
        <h3>Interactive Pele &amp; SVG Diagrams</h3>
        <p>Complex distributed systems shouldn't be black boxes. We turn etcd quorums, eBPF kernel hooks, CNI packet traversal, component threat models, and Operator reconcile loops into responsive, interactive visual mental models.</p>
        <a class="kube-learning-action" href="/threat-model">Explore visual threat model →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Production Rigor</span>
        <h3>Zero-Paywall Master Labs</h3>
        <p>24 battle-tested master labs covering the full CKA, CKAD, and CKS curriculum, Linux container namespaces, Kyverno policies, Argo CD GitOps, Karpenter autoscaling, and building memory-safe operators in Rust with kube-rs.</p>
        <a class="kube-learning-action" href="/labs">Browse all 24 labs →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="kube-pillar-card">
        <div class="kube-pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</div>
        <span class="kube-learning-step">Open Ecosystem</span>
        <h3>340+ Curated Tool Directory</h3>
